    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n31871" root="غسل" body-key="g">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُغْتَسَلٌ</span></b>  <i>A place in which one washes himself:</i>
(O, Msb, TA: *) dim. ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُغَيْسِلٌ</span></b> : and pl. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَغَاسِيلُ</span>
[which, if correct, is anomalous]. (TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  And
it is said to signify also what is called in Pers.
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حوض مَسِين</span> [or <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حَوْض مِسِين</span> app. meaning <i>A
tank,</i> or <i>the like, of copper</i>]. (Mgh.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  See also
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَغْسِلٌ</span>. ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b4-  And see <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">غَسُولٌ</span>.

